"The last child of the node, if there are any, or ``None``. This is a read-"
"only attribute."
msgstr ""
"Nodens sista barn, om det finns några, eller ``None``. Detta är ett "
"skrivskyddat attribut."

#: ../../library/xml.dom.rst:342
msgid ""
"The part of the :attr:`~Element.tagName` following the colon if there is "
"one, else the entire :attr:`~Element.tagName`.  The value is a string."
