"The part of the :attr:`~Element.tagName` preceding the colon if there is "
"one, else the empty string.  The value is a string, or ``None``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/xml.dom.rst:354
msgid ""
"The namespace associated with the element name.  This will be a string or "
"``None``.  This is a read-only attribute."
msgstr ""
"Namnrymden som är associerad med elementnamnet.  Detta kommer att vara en "
"sträng eller ``None``.  Detta är ett skrivskyddat attribut."

#: ../../library/xml.dom.rst:360
msgid ""
"The :class:`Document` object to which this node belongs, or ``None`` for a "
"document itself. This is a read-only attribute."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/xml.dom.rst:367
