"Associate *data* with *key* on this node and return the data previously "
"associated with *key*, or ``None``. If *data* is ``None``, the association "
"is removed. *handler* is called when the node is cloned, imported, renamed "
"or deleted; pass ``None`` if no notification is needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/xml.dom.rst:382
